WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.260
Namaste. Kai grahak pehle sirf daam poochhte hain, khaaskar contractor aur bade order waale.

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:16.942
Is video mein dekhenge ki quotation kaise banate hain, WhatsApp par PDF ke saath kaise bhejte hain, aur grahak haan bole to ek tap mein bill kaise banta hai.

00:00:16.942 --> 00:00:19.051
Ye hardware ka public demo hai.

00:00:19.376 --> 00:00:21.799
New bill par hi quotation banta hai.

00:00:21.799 --> 00:00:27.587
Customer chunte hain, aur jo saaman chahiye wo jodte hain, jaise bill mein jodte hain.

00:00:34.813 --> 00:00:42.164
Complete bill dabate hain. Neeche ek naya hissa hai: Customer only wants a price for now.

00:00:42.164 --> 00:00:49.184
Quotation kitne din valid rahega, wo chunte hain, pandrah din, aur Save as quotation.

00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:59.976
Quotation ban gaya, apne number ke saath. Ismein items, rate, GST, total aur valid till ki tareekh hai.

00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:08.989
Send quotation on WhatsApp se grahak ko poora quotation aur uska PDF link jaata hai, bilkul bill ki tarah.

00:01:09.359 --> 00:01:16.015
Grahak link kholta hai to use aisa page dikhta hai, bina login ke. Yahan se wo PDF le sakta hai.

00:01:16.015 --> 00:01:21.770
Uska phone number is page par nahi dikhta, kyunki link aage bhi bheja ja sakta hai.

00:01:27.144 --> 00:01:31.833
Kuch din baad grahak haan bolta hai. Quotations ki list kholte hain.

00:01:31.833 --> 00:01:36.315
Yahan khule, bill ho chuke aur khatam quotation alag dikhte hain.

00:01:37.618 --> 00:01:43.529
Quotation kholte hain aur Make bill dabate hain. Saare items apne aap bill mein aa gaye.

00:01:43.529 --> 00:01:51.589
Aur jab tak quotation valid hai, wahi daam lagte hain jo quotation mein bataye the, chahe beech mein rate badal gaya ho.

00:01:52.966 --> 00:02:01.145
Complete bill, Fully paid aur Generate invoice. Bill ban gaya, aur quotation apne aap Billed ho gaya.

00:02:01.145 --> 00:02:03.737
Ab wo dobara bill nahi ho sakta.

00:02:05.878 --> 00:02:16.140
To quotation se bill ka poora raasta: New bill par saaman jodo, Save as quotation, WhatsApp par PDF bhejo, aur haan milte hi Make bill.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:20.169
Kagaz ka estimate kho jaata hai, ye nahi. Dhanyavaad.
